            <ArticleTitle>Biofeedback in pain management: Bier blocks for complex regional pain syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This feature presents information for patients in a question and answer format. It is written to simulate actual questions that many pain patients ask and to provide answers in a context and language that most pain patients will comprehend. Issues addressed in this issue are the role of the biofeedback in pain management and Bier blocks for complex regional pain syndrome.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
